===Congress===
Of 158 congressmen to be elected, 126 congressmen sought re-election but only 56 were re-elected and 102 new congressmen were elected for the first time since democratic election took root in Guatemala. About 65% of MPs were first time representatives, which was the first time this occurred since the [[1995 Guatemalan general election|1995 election]].{{Citation needed|date=November 2011}}

